      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932861273248838074",
      "text": "[7PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nCongested traffic on Ijaye Road, particularly on the stretch connecting to Oba Ogunji, due to the return journey and ongoing alternation of traffic flow.\nBusy movement on Old Abeokuta Motor Road from Isokoko inward to Total underneath the bridge, resulting from alternation and return journey traffic.\nSmooth traffic flow from Nitel up to Abattoir, with unhindered movement observed.\nGood movement on Old Ipaja Road from Oke Koto inward to Shofunde, as well as from Olufunlayo up to Alaagba Junction, where traffic is flowing in an orderly manner.\nHeavy traffic congestion on Oba Akran inward to Dangote U-turn, connecting to Mobil Ashade down to Akilo, due to a high influx of vehicles.\nMoving traffic observed on Guinness inward to Akanni Doherty, indicating a relatively smooth flow.\nUnimpeded movement on Capitol inward Oniwaya Junction up to Alfa Nla, where traffic is moving freely.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
