      "text": "[7:33PM] #AjasaCommand #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from Megida down to Amule and Church Roundabout, with unhindered movement observed.\nGood traffic conditions on Adefemi and Ikola Oju-Odo down to Command, with traffic flowing freely.\nGood movement at Ile-Iwe down to Ekoro, where a non-functioning traffic light has necessitated manual traffic control by our personnel.\n\nOur dedicated Officers are actively managing the traffic situation, working to ensure a safe and orderly flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
