      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932884770041569466",
      "text": "[8:30PM] #Mushin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic flow from Moshalasi Alakara Police Station down to Idi Oro.\nConoil Idioro to Olosha, Ogunmokun Junction, Ojuwoye Post Office down to Olupese is good.\nOshodi Underneath Bridge, Train Station Oshodi, Brown Junction down to Arena, with steady movement.\n\nReturn journey from Bolade Oshodi Brown Junction to Goro, is good traffic flow.\nOshodi Oke descending to Goro by Terminal 2, is smooth movement.\nOshodi Underneath Bridge ascending Oshodi Oke by Terminal 1, is good.\nGood traffic movement on Olupese Cappa down to Ojuwoye, as well as on Ojuwoye connecting to Isolo Road down to Palm Avenue, Oye Roundabout inward to Lasutech, with a similar trend observed on the return journey from Daleko Bridge down to Zone D Pako Junction.\nSteady movement from Alasalatu down to Mushin Ile Epo Isale, despite some traffic turning.\nUnimpeded traffic flow on Total inward from Idi Oro down to Moshalasi.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
