      "text": "[8:38PM] #PWD #TrafficUpdate \n\nUnobstructed movement on the stretch of Iyana Dopemu Underneath Bridge inward Bolade Intersection, with a similarly smooth return journey.\nGood traffic flow on Ile-Zik connecting to Sule Junction.\nEfficient traffic management facilitated by well-functioning traffic lights within the corridors.\n\nOur officers are actively managing traffic, and the area is currently free of impediments, ensuring a safe and orderly flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
