      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1932885657489215560",
      "text": "[8:32PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nFast-moving traffic from Otedola inward Berger Oke, with a similarly smooth return journey.\nGood traffic flow on the stretch of Isheri Olowora, River Valley, and Ogunnusi Road.\nImproved movement observed towards Excellence, Yaya Abaton, and Kayode, with encouraging traffic flow to Caterpillar, Odo Eran, and Wempco.\nGood traffic conditions on the return journey from Wempco to Odo Eran and Caterpillar.\nSmooth movement from Wempco to Lateef Jakande, connecting to Omole Junction, Omole Gate, VIS, River Valley, and Isheri Olowora.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
