      "text": "[8:48PM] #Ketu #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Ojota inward Interchange, with smooth traffic flow ascending the bridge towards the toll gate.\nMoving traffic observed on Interchange inward to Tipper Garage and Demurin Junction, although there is slow movement approaching Demurin Junction due to evening rush and pedestrian activity.\nGood traffic flow from Demurin inward to Ile-Ile, Iyana School down to Kosofe and Mile 12, with moving traffic.\nSmooth return journey from Iyana School inward to Ile-Ile, Ikosi Junction, Fruit Market, and Interchange inward to Ojota Proper.\n\nOur officers are actively managing traffic, ensuring a safe and orderly flow of traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
